// Within a group the rows are shown in this order; the keys 1-9 pick the modes in the same order.

// Columns of a kModes row (struct ModeDef in app.h), in order:
//   family   the receiver family number: stored in the settings and handled by setMode() / modeTuning(), never renumber
//   name     the short label in the mode lists and the top bar
//   group    index into kGroupNames: which heading of the mode list the row sits under (UI only, nothing stores it)
//   col      the colour of the row's chip in the mode lists
//   blurb    the one-line description shown under the mode selector (the mode search matches it too)
//   tip      the longer tooltip on hover over the mode
//   sub      the small second line, N_() so it is translated
//   accent   the colour of the mode's name in the top bar
//   subId    (optional) the protocol inside a shared family (dect2::subModes()); nullptr for a mode of its own
